SEQUENCE ALIGNMENT
------------------

Input data: 118 taxa with 4 partitions and 4114 total sites (32.0666% missing data)

  ID	Type	Seq	Site	Unique	Infor	Invar	Const	Name
   1	DNA	114	512	366	199	251	251	COI_pos1
   2	DNA	114	512	281	81	361	361	COI_pos2
   3	DNA	114	512	495	448	23	23	COI_pos3
   4	DNA	60	2578	779	690	1765	1765	r18S+r28S

Column meanings:
  Unique: Number of unique site patterns
  Infor:  Number of parsimony-informative sites
  Invar:  Number of invariant sites
  Const:  Number of constant sites (can be subset of invariant sites)

ModelFinder
-----------

Best-fit model according to BIC: GTR+F+I+G4:COI_pos1,GTR+F+R4:COI_pos2,TPM2u+F+R4:COI_pos3,GTR+F+I+R3:r18S+r28S

List of best-fit models per partition:

  ID  Model                  LogL         AIC      w-AIC        AICc     w-AICc         BIC      w-BIC
   1  GTR+F+I+G4        -6944.013   13910.026 + 1.85e-315   13910.554 - 5.35e-317   13956.648 - 7.18e-317
   2  GTR+F+R4          -2938.285    5906.571 + 1.85e-315    5907.538 - 5.35e-317    5970.145 - 7.18e-317
   3  TPM2u+F+R4       -17970.702   35965.404 + 1.85e-315   35966.029 - 5.35e-317   36016.264 - 7.18e-317
   4  GTR+F+I+R3       -17466.843   34961.686 + 1.85e-315   34961.850 - 5.35e-317   35043.653 - 7.18e-317

AIC, w-AIC   : Akaike information criterion scores and weights.
AICc, w-AICc : Corrected AIC scores and weights.
BIC, w-BIC   : Bayesian information criterion scores and weights.

Plus signs denote the 95% confidence sets.
Minus signs denote significant exclusion.

